{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER: Frutiger Space is currently under development, and much of what you see is still a work in progress. If something appears incomplete or wonky, don't worry, it's either being updated or will be fixed in future updates. </strong><br><strong>Stay connected for updates through our official channels! (linked on the right)</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frutiger Space is a social multiplayer game set in a utopian universe, reminiscent of the aesthetic of the internet's heyday. it\u2019s a place where everyone can feel at home: whether you're exploring, playing minigames, accessorizing your Meeple, getting in on some secrets, or just rocking out to music bobbing in a bubble, there's always something to do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/718d8b7474881d7306a4622e13a67582.avif?t=1761818223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras_big/718d8b7474881d7306a4622e13a67582.avif?t=1761818223 width=1560 height=810 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chat with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frutiger Space carries the spirit of early 2000s social games, with the goal of creating a place where players can connect, form new friendships, and be part of a warm and inclusive community!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World of Frutiger Aero Subgenres</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area in the map has its own style, influenced by various Frutiger Aero subgenres, such as <strong>Frutiger Eco, Frutiger Aqua, Frutiger Metro, Technozen</strong> and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/b75cec03639da5f52e9c22733d9c98a9.avif?t=1761818223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras_big/b75cec03639da5f52e9c22733d9c98a9.avif?t=1761818223 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meeple Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Meeple</strong> can be personalised with a huge selection of cosmetics. Express your personality with unique outfits, stylish hats, and accessories. You can purchase new things with <strong>Frutiger Orbs</strong>, which are obtained by playing minigames, completing tasks, or simply exploring the world to discover its riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/a4f5202d082881a44c9c23bc81d3ead8.avif?t=1761818223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras_big/a4f5202d082881a44c9c23bc81d3ead8.avif?t=1761818223 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Activities and Minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frutiger Space also features a collection of minigames and activities to have fun with! <br>Of course, no grinding and sweating. The main ones include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dolphin Racing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watergun Battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fruit Collecting</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much more to come!</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591510?t=1761818223","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/55dfbee9dd08cd57b2d1bce1ba9d3d1f330c064c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761818223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/6ecfa432d565d91b